    "name": "Urban Project",
    "steam_appid": 3515760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Beautiful and Charming Cities in This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you won\u2019t have to deal with complex tasks like micromanagement or resource tracking. Just relax and build your own city, increasing profits and completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/297539427babf680db27536487e23a19.poster.avif?t=1750250783\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/297539427babf680db27536487e23a19.webm?t=1750250783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/297539427babf680db27536487e23a19.mp4?t=1750250783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find a wide variety of buildings, each with unique behavior. The income from many structures depends on their location and neighbors, so you'll need to decide where to place your buildings for maximum benefit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here are just a few:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amusement Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And over 30 more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel that a building is placed in a way that hinders your plans, you can always demolish it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game session gives you <strong>two quests</strong> to complete in order to win, along with <strong>one limitation\u00a0</strong>that cannot be broken. With a variety of missions and restrictions available, every game will feel unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/dad2fae490c47b3d28d4e5b1e029ab1e.avif?t=1750250783\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of Danger</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/ef651728d992c26a4cd61d4574d17814.poster.avif?t=1750250783\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/ef651728d992c26a4cd61d4574d17814.webm?t=1750250783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515760/extras/ef651728d992c26a4cd61d4574d17814.mp4?t=1750250783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be developing your city in a rather hazardous area, so from time to time, you will face various events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These may be natural disasters like:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tornadoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsunamis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or human-caused crises such as:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fires</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic crises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so on.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you simply want to build your dream city, there's a <strong>sandbox mode</strong> for you. In this mode, there are no missions, no time limits, and you can even disable disasters. Nothing will stand in the way of your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
